# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=The Isobar Club
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Nimbus Works' eighth station: the company's members' club on a granite shelf - tidal pools, a funicular up the rise, a white pavilion with a colonnade and pianos, and a wine cellar with somebody locked in it. The eighth island of The Rainmakers. Raft-sized: high ground, a cave, a ruined house where Lord Arvid Hale still lives, a crashed plane and secrets off the path.
island on.arrive=message||A granite shelf with pools in the rock, and up the rise a white pavilion with columns. Music once. Nobody now.

story cabinetkey|Cabinet key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The club secretary's cabinet key, from his safe.
story cellarkey|Cellar key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The wine cellar's key, from the secretary's cabinet.

note membersbook Members' book | THE ISOBAR CLUB - MEMBERS' BOOK\n\nNimbus Works directors and guests only. Ring for the funicular.\n\n(the last pages, in one hand: Holm, D. - Holm, D. - Holm, D. - every night for a month, and in the margin: "she's still down there")
note boardminutes Board minutes | NIMBUS WORKS - MINUTES OF THE BOARD\n\nItem 1. The Chief Engineer asks that the Rain Engine be switched off. The sea has risen four metres.\nItem 2. The board votes to keep the Engine ON. Contracts are contracts.\nItem 3. Mrs Holm to be kept in the club's cellar until she calms down.\nItem 4. The secretary's safe code is changed to 6206.
note secsafe Secretary's safe | The secretary's safe: a key tagged CABINET, the club's silver and a stack of unpaid rain contracts.
loot secsafe story:cabinetkey*1;Glass*2;Bolt*2
prop secsafe loot.refill=0
prop secsafe if.open=signal|safe
prop secsafe else.open=message||The safe is locked from the keypad beside it.
note seccabinet Secretary's cabinet | The secretary's cabinet: Nimbus Works' last plans - titanium tools, a big backpack, an electric zipline handle - and a key on a ribbon, CELLAR.
loot seccabinet Blueprint_TitaniumTools*1;Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced*1;Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric*1;story:cellarkey*1;Cooked_GenericMeat*2
prop seccabinet loot.refill=0
prop seccabinet if.open=has|story:cabinetkey|1
prop seccabinet else.open=message||The secretary's cabinet is locked. Its key would be in his safe.
note dagnycase Dagny's case | Dagny Holm's case: her drawing instruments, a notebook of figures, and the Rain Engine's master switch plan, folded small.
loot dagnycase Rope*2;Bolt*2;Plank*4;Cooked_GenericMeat*2
prop dagnycase loot.refill=0
prop dagnycase if.open=signal|dagnyfree
prop dagnycase else.open=message||The case is inside the cage, under the engineer's hand.

prop safekeypad obj.name=safekeypad
prop safekeypad beh.use=Type the safe's code
prop safekeypad lock.code=6206
prop safekeypad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||The keypad chirps and the safe's bolts slide back.\nsignal||safe
prop dagnycage obj.name=dagnycage
prop dagnycage survivor.name=Dagny
prop dagnycage survivor.id=rainmakers_dagny
prop dagnycage survivor.key=cellarkey
prop dagnycage survivor.signal=dagnyfree
prop dagnycage survivor.line=They kept me here so I couldn't switch it off. I'm Dagny Holm. I built the Rain Engine - and I know where its master switch is. Take me there.

prop terracezone zone.id=terrace
prop terracezone zone.radius=5
prop terracezone zone.message=The club's lower terrace: pools in the rock, a book on a stand, and a lift up the rise.
prop clubzone zone.id=club
prop clubzone zone.radius=3.5
prop clubzone zone.message=The Isobar Club: a white pavilion, its colonnade, its doors open on the dark.
prop cellarzone zone.id=cellar
prop cellarzone zone.radius=3
prop cellarzone zone.message=The wine cellar: casks, a cage - and somebody in it.

story ic_top|Mast barometer|Bolt|The club's silver barometer, unscrewed from the weather mast.
story ic_cave|Members' seal|Bolt|The club's members' seal, hidden in the smugglers' cave.
story ic_fixed|Club signal working|Bolt|The club signal, working again.
note ic_hint Steward's notice | THE CLUB SIGNAL IS DARK. It wants the barometer from the weather mast on Barometer Hill and the members' seal from the Smugglers' Cave. Lord Hale at the old folly will tell you, if you let him. The hedge maze is for members.
note ic_topchest Club's weather mast deck box | A box lashed to the deck rail at the top of the club's weather mast.
loot ic_topchest story:ic_top*1;Rope*2;Scrap*2
note ic_cavechest Smugglers' Cave chest | A chest at the back of Smugglers' Cave, dry under the rock.
loot ic_cavechest story:ic_cave*1;TradeToken*2;Glass*2
note ic_rewnote Signal book | The signal lamp flashes out to sea - the old call to the members' yachts. In its box: the signal book, every member who came to watch the rain they paid for.
note ic_rewchest Club signal reward | What the club signal kept.
loot ic_rewchest Glass*2;Bolt*3;TradeToken*3
note ic_lampchest Lord Hale's strongbox | Lord Hale's strongbox: his club tie, a cigar case and a lot of tokens.
loot ic_lampchest TradeToken*3;Glass*2;CopperIngot*1
note ic_setchest Trophy case | The club's trophy case: every medal back, and the prize purse.
loot ic_setchest TradeToken*3;MetalIngot*2;Glass*2
note ic_planecrate Member's plane crate | A member's plane crate: wine, a picnic set, a rifle case (empty).
loot ic_planecrate Glass*2;Scrap*3;Plastic*2
prop ic_planecrate loot.refill=0
note ic_pilot Member's flight card | ISOBAR CLUB REGATTA. Flew in for the rain show. Landing gear failed. The steward never came. Do send someone.
note jcic Folly perch | The members' climbing folly, built for wagers.
loot jcic Rope*3;Plank*4;MetalIngot*1
note jbic Folly top | The wager's prize at the top.
loot jbic CopperIngot*1;Bolt*2;TradeToken*2
note ic_mazechest Maze prize | The prize at the heart of the members' hedge maze.
loot ic_mazechest TradeToken*3;Glass*2;CopperIngot*2

quest title=Members Only
quest intro=A granite shelf with a white pavilion on it. Make for the white pavilion on the granite shelf and land on the lower terrace below it.
step reach|terrace|1|Make for the white pavilion and land on the lower terrace
step read|Members' book|1|Read the members' book on its stand
step reach|club|1|Ride the funicular up to the club
step read|Board minutes|1|Read the board minutes on the billiard table
step open|Secretary's safe|1|Open the secretary's safe (its keypad code is in the minutes)
step open|Secretary's cabinet|1|Open the secretary's cabinet with the key from the safe
step blueprint|Blueprint_TitaniumTools|1|Take the titanium tools plans from the secretary's cabinet
step blueprint|Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced|1|Take the advanced backpack plans from the secretary's cabinet
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric|1|Take the electric zipline tool plans from the secretary's cabinet
step read|Steward's notice|1|Read the steward's notice by the club signal
step talk|Lord Arvid Hale|1|Talk to Lord Arvid Hale at the ruined house away from the club
step reach|ic_trail|1|Find the foot of the trail up Barometer Hill, below the weather mast
step reach|ic_summit|1|Climb the trail to the top of Barometer Hill
step collect|story:ic_top|1|Climb the club's weather mast and take the mast barometer from the box on its deck
step reach|ic_cave|1|Find Smugglers' Cave, the rock cave in the far hillside
step collect|story:ic_cave|1|Take the members' seal from the chest at the back of the cave
step read|Signal book|1|Bring both to the club signal and read what it shows
step open|Dagny's case|1|Free the prisoner in the wine cellar and take her case
quest done=Dagny Holm is coming with you, and she knows the way to the Rain Engine. Its station answers on 1400.
quest reward=Glass*4;Bolt*4;MetalIngot*3

# --- Raft's vending machine by the members' shop, from Tangaroa's arcade: Tangaroa's plants for its tokens; three tokens lie about --
push at 0 -35
vending clubvend at 18 -4 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 12 4 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 16 -12 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 18 0 ground

# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=25 n=1 seed=8826
prop treasure8826 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

# Animals (reach audit 10-24: a late island of its story line had none)
place Creature_Goat goats at 0 12 ground
pop
prop goats creature.count=2

save The Isobar Club
